1
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:02,840
What did you go to Bangkok for,
District Chief?

2
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,040
I went there to get married.

3
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,160
-Married?
-Married?

4
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:06,200
Here she is.

5
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:10,919
-Tri?
-Sasi?

6
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:13,360
You must take them down today.

7
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:16,080
I've noted every single detail,
including the escape routes.

8
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:18,680
Freeze! Don't move! Drop your weapon!

9
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:23,840
Die, you bastard.

10
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,640
<i>They used to be engaged.</i>

11
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:33,440
Old flames won't reignite,
will they, Rajit?

12
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:36,680
<i>Thatri and the Japanese will turn</i>
<i>Phuket upside down hunting you.</i>

13
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:39,040
I'll have someone smuggle you out
before dawn tomorrow.

14
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:54,360
The boss told me to flee to Langkawi.
Where the hell is the boat?

15
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:57,040
We can't take you ourselves, Boss.

16
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,960
We had to hire smugglers to get you out.

17
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:01,200
They told us to meet here.

18
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:03,040
They said they'd bring a boat.

19
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:07,000
You'll have to hide
in the cargo hold with the fish crates.

20
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,360
Yeah, I know.

21
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,760
Did the boss order you to do this?

22
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:29,640
Forgive us, but we have no choice.

23
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:33,080
If we let you live,
the boss will be compromised.

24
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:35,760
So I'm no longer useful.

25
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:39,480
The boss is quite generous,

26
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,840
giving me pocket money before I die.

27
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,520
Since I won't be needing it,

28
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,440
you boys can have it!

29
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,360
Hey!

30
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,200
You!

31
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:06,440
You thought you could kill me, Boss?

32
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:26,240
Thatri.

33
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:31,880
I was surprised to hear you were here.

34
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:34,440
Why didn't you let me go
to Som Song Saeng House instead?

35
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:36,600
How could I?

36
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:39,720
I'm younger, so it's only proper
that I visit you myself, Fuang.

37
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:44,760
There's no need to be so polite.
We're family, after all.

38
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:47,480
So, what brings you here today?

39
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,480
I brought something back for you.

40
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,640
What is it?

41
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:15,040
What kind of pearl is this?

42
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,920
This isn't mine.

43
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,320
If you're so sure,

44
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:24,000
would you mind if I searched your house?

45
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:34,040
Who do you think you are
to search my sister's house?

46
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:36,120
Get the hell out of here right now.

47
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:54,240
I can't do that.
Not until I clear my suspicions

48
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:57,000
that Fuang is behind the pirates

49
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:58,920
and the looting in Phuket.

50
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,760
How can you be so heartless?

51
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:05,440
Why are you framing me?
What did I ever do to you?

52
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,800
First, you steal our inheritance,

53
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:10,880
now you accuse my sister
of being a criminal?

54
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:13,280
You deserve a good slap…

55
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,280
What is that?

56
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:30,560
At first, I didn't believe
Fuang could do such a thing either,

57
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:33,520
until I read these records thoroughly.

58
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:36,480
The pearl Zhang Gong Cheng used

59
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:39,120
is duller than Phuket's saltwater pearls.

60
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,360
This means it's a freshwater pearl.

61
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:43,080
It's cheaper,

62
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:45,880
and not a single vendor
in Phuket sells them.

63
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:49,960
So what?

64
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:52,120
Are you saying Fuang
ordered them to sell here?

65
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:55,640
Not quite, but an order
was definitely placed.

66
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,200
Look at the buyer's name.

67
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:00,600
FUANGFAH SRISAWANG

68
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:03,280
Fuangfah Srisawang. She's the only one.

69
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:07,320
Even if I ordered them,

70
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:10,720
that doesn't mean I have anything
to do with those pirates.

71
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:14,080
Yeah. Don't make accusations
out of thin air.

72
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,160
Right.

73
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:24,880
What are you trying to pull now?

74
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:27,880
I'm actually impressed
by how calm you are, Fuang,

75
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:29,800
kKnowing full well these pearls

76
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,880
were bought to atone
for the lives you took,

77
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:33,440
based on your twisted belief.

78
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:35,640
You still manage to divert attention,

79
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:38,120
but I came better prepared than you think.

80
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:39,640
Zhang Gong Cheng

81
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:42,720
stole those goods
from the Japanese Army a few days ago,

82
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:45,360
but I had already marked all of them.

83
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:49,520
Once they distributed the loot,
it was easy to track them down.

84
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,360
That's how I managed

85
00:07:51,440 --> 00:07:55,040
to take down your entire network at once.

86
00:07:57,880 --> 00:08:00,440
Hey. Are you out of your mind?

87
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:02,640
You're talking nonsense.

88
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:04,680
Exactly.

89
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:07,920
Although we recovered
most of the stolen loot

90
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,880
when we raided
Zhang Gong Cheng's warehouse,

91
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,680
some are still missing.

92
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:15,240
I believe you kept some for yourself.

93
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:18,120
If we search this house,
we'll definitely find them.

94
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:19,680
Pae, help me.

95
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:24,240
I do not allow this. I won't let you
search my sister's house.

96
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,000
Freeze! Don't move!

97
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:30,440
-Put the gun down!
-Put it down!

98
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:31,840
Hurry! Put it down!

99
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:34,039
-Put it down right now!
-Hurry up!

100
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:36,520
-Put the gun down!
-Put it down!

101
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,600
Hey!

102
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:49,120
The police are probably here.
Turn yourself in, Fuang.

103
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,560
Don't come any closer, or she dies!

104
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:00,520
Fuang!

105
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,800
What are you doing to your own sister?

106
00:09:02,880 --> 00:09:04,720
It's obvious. Why are you even asking?

107
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:09,800
Thatri. Do something.
Why are you just standing there talking?

108
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:12,760
Stay back. If you move,

109
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,560
I'll blow her brains out.

110
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:16,880
Are you really going to kill me, Fuang?

111
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,080
Shut up! Do you want to die?

112
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:25,200
She's your sister. Go ahead if you want.

113
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,960
Did you think you could manipulate me?

114
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:30,160
What the hell, Thatri.

115
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,480
Go fool someone else.

116
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:36,480
A guy like you can't bear
to watch someone die.

117
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:38,480
But I can.

118
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:41,480
Are you really going to kill me?
You wretched sister! You evil!

119
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:43,360
Stop screeching in my ear. It's annoying!

120
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:47,120
Fuang, calm down, please.

121
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:49,960
Stay back.

122
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:51,880
Out of my way.

123
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:54,920
Come here.

124
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,200
Walk!

125
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:59,920
Move your legs
unless you want them blown off!

126
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:01,760
Stay back!

127
00:10:05,760 --> 00:10:06,680
Don't move.

128
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,080
Walk.

129
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:17,960
Are you alright, Pae?

130
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:21,440
Stay here and don't go outside.
It's too dangerous.

131
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,760
Damn it.

132
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:01,640
That wretched sister.

133
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:06,480
I can't believe
she's worse than I thought.

134
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:11,280
I always believed she was an angel
and I was the demon.

135
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:14,440
Turns out she's pure evil.

136
00:11:15,040 --> 00:11:17,480
She actually tried to kill me.

137
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:26,240
Well? Did you catch that wicked woman?

138
00:11:28,800 --> 00:11:31,920
But the police are blocking the roads.
She can't escape for long.

139
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:37,360
We found the pearls and the stolen goods.

140
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:39,360
They have the markings you described.

141
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,320
Freshwater pearls,

142
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:53,600
identical to the ones at the crime scene.

143
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:55,440
Thank you.

144
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:58,720
Please look after Paetai.

145
00:11:58,800 --> 00:12:01,040
I need to go after Fuang.

146
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,080
Understood.

147
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,640
Make sure you get her.

148
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:09,360
Otherwise, I'll go drag her back myself.

149
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:26,640
Vehicle search, please.

150
00:13:07,920 --> 00:13:08,760
Aunt Fuang?

151
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:11,520
Who are you looking for?

152
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:16,480
I was looking for you, Rajit.
I'm just dealing with something right now.

153
00:13:20,280 --> 00:13:21,480
Is something wrong?

154
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:25,600
The workers just told me
that our cargo ship is damaged.

155
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:29,280
We must find a boat to get the goods.
I don't know what to do.

156
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:33,640
In that case, let me go and help you.

157
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:35,680
That's great, dear.

158
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:43,880
Nid, perfect timing. Go get the driver.

159
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:46,040
We're heading to the pier.

160
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:48,520
-Yes, miss.
-There's no need for that.

161
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:54,120
Uh, well, if we don't call the driver,
how are we going to get there?

162
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:56,040
We can just take my car.

163
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:59,440
Then let's take Nid with us to help.

164
00:13:59,520 --> 00:14:02,280
You should stay and do your work here.
That's for the best.

165
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:05,320
I've already finished all my chores.

166
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:07,960
Please let me go with you.
I can help prepare the boat.

167
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,520
Then let's get moving.

168
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:17,800
Jiam, I'll be back soon.

169
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:19,120
Yes, miss.

170
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:23,360
Hey. Make sure you help them,
and don't be a burden.

171
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:25,120
Yes, Grandma.

172
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:27,280
Let's go.

173
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:36,840
District Chief, how are you feeling?

174
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,760
I'm feeling much better now.

175
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:42,960
Well then, let's get going.

176
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:45,240
Where are you all headed?

177
00:14:46,880 --> 00:14:51,240
We're going to the pier.
There's an issue with the cargo ship.

178
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,920
Please make yourself at home.

179
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,240
Alright.

180
00:14:55,160 --> 00:14:56,840
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

181
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,680
-Have a seat here.
-Okay.

182
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,440
Thank you.

183
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:24,800
Getting some fresh air like this

184
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:26,760
makes me feel so much better.

185
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:31,200
I was so bored with staying
inside those four walls.

186
00:15:44,600 --> 00:15:46,480
Here is some O-aew.

187
00:15:47,160 --> 00:15:48,440
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

188
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:49,640
It's alright.

189
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,440
Mr. Thatri.

190
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:58,520
You look much stronger now,
District Chief.

191
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:02,560
Yes. And where have you been all day?

192
00:16:02,640 --> 00:16:04,440
I was sorting out
the Zhang Gong Cheng case.

193
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:09,800
I was about to tell you about it.

194
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:16,520
Where did Rajit go, Aunt Jiam?

195
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:20,840
She went with Ms. Fuang.
Nid went along with them.

196
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:23,800
Fuang was here?

197
00:16:23,880 --> 00:16:26,360
-Yes, sir.
-How long ago did they leave?

198
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:29,040
About half an hour ago.

199
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:31,920
Did she say where they were going?

200
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:34,520
To the pier.

201
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:38,120
Is something wrong, Mr. Thatri?

202
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:40,040
I'll tell you later. I have to go now.

203
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:41,120
Hold on.

204
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:46,840
You're in such a rush.
It must be something serious.

205
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:47,760
I'm coming with you.

206
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:50,280
But you're still hurt.

207
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:54,920
I know, but I'm the District Chief here.

208
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:56,720
I can't just sit idly by.

209
00:16:58,560 --> 00:17:01,320
Let me join you. I can still assist.

210
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:05,520
Alright.

211
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:40,440
The cargo pier

212
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:43,280
isn't around here, is it?

213
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:45,720
Exactly. From what I recall,

214
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:47,960
this road doesn't look familiar.

215
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:52,000
This is a shortcut
from the Som Song Saeng house, dear.

216
00:17:52,080 --> 00:17:54,040
Are you sure?

217
00:17:54,120 --> 00:17:56,440
When Grandfather was alive,

218
00:17:56,520 --> 00:17:59,600
he showed me every single route.

219
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:02,680
But I've never seen this one before.

220
00:18:02,760 --> 00:18:04,680
I've tagged along many times,

221
00:18:05,480 --> 00:18:07,440
and I've never taken this route either.

222
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:12,640
We've searched multiple piers
and found nothing.

223
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:15,720
Where did Ms. Fuangfah take Miss Rajit?

224
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:19,680
I figured as much.
Fuang wouldn't run somewhere that obvious.

225
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:22,480
Then how are we going to find them?

226
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:25,880
I don't care how many piers Phuket has.

227
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:28,160
I will find Rajit, no matter what.

228
00:18:36,120 --> 00:18:37,920
Aunt Fuang, are you lost?

229
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:41,000
I think we should head back
the way we came.

230
00:18:41,080 --> 00:18:43,080
I agree. I'll give you the directions.

231
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:46,560
Exactly. If we take any longer,

232
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:49,200
the cargo will sustain more damage.

233
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:51,440
Shut your mouth!

234
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:52,440
You never stop talking!

235
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:54,200
Do you want to die?

236
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:56,000
Aunt Fuang…

237
00:18:58,480 --> 00:18:59,720
Watch out!

238
00:19:45,600 --> 00:19:46,600
Get out of the car.

239
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:50,520
I said, get out.

240
00:19:59,720 --> 00:20:00,840
Nid…

241
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:05,200
Leave him there. You're coming with me.

242
00:20:05,280 --> 00:20:08,480
-But…
-If you don't want to die, move.

243
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:11,120
Walk.

244
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,400
I told you to walk.

245
00:20:14,960 --> 00:20:16,240
Move.

246
00:20:17,520 --> 00:20:19,000
Keep moving.

247
00:20:22,800 --> 00:20:23,760
-Go.
-Miss Rajit…

248
00:20:29,680 --> 00:20:31,040
-Nid! Nid!
-Miss…

249
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:34,200
Miss Rajit, run away!

250
00:20:35,520 --> 00:20:36,360
Watch out!

251
00:20:45,520 --> 00:20:47,960
-Nid!
-Stop!

252
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:51,800
Get going before I decide
to shoot you next.

253
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:53,800
Move!

254
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,560
Go!

255
00:20:57,560 --> 00:20:58,880
Miss Rajit…

256
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:01,000
Keep moving.

257
00:21:14,400 --> 00:21:16,560
Any slower and I'll shoot you.

258
00:21:17,160 --> 00:21:18,760
Move faster.

259
00:21:24,680 --> 00:21:26,680
Why are you doing this?

260
00:21:28,120 --> 00:21:29,640
I never thought

261
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:33,640
a sweet aunt like you

262
00:21:34,320 --> 00:21:36,680
could do something so evil.

263
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:40,520
You really know nothing, do you?

264
00:21:41,080 --> 00:21:43,320
You spoiled little niece.

265
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:44,920
What do you mean by that?

266
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:50,120
I should've let Zhang Gong Cheng kill you

267
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:53,360
when he dragged you
and Thatri onto that boat.

268
00:21:54,560 --> 00:21:55,400
Does this…

269
00:21:56,880 --> 00:21:58,360
Does this mean

270
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:01,400
you were the mastermind

271
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:04,120
behind that Zhang Gong Cheng?

272
00:22:04,880 --> 00:22:06,480
Is that true?

273
00:22:06,560 --> 00:22:08,680
Now you know, you fool.

274
00:22:08,760 --> 00:22:10,320
But thanks

275
00:22:11,120 --> 00:22:13,960
for being stupid enough
to become my hostage again.

276
00:22:14,040 --> 00:22:15,720
Why would you do this?

277
00:22:16,800 --> 00:22:19,800
If it were anyone else,
I wouldn't be surprised.

278
00:22:20,600 --> 00:22:22,040
But why does it have to be you?

279
00:22:22,120 --> 00:22:23,320
Because of you!

280
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:25,880
You inherit every single thing
while I get nothing.

281
00:22:26,400 --> 00:22:28,040
That's why I had to do this!

282
00:22:30,120 --> 00:22:33,720
TAILOR SHOP

283
00:22:51,840 --> 00:22:54,880
Aren't you buying it? It's only 35 baht.

284
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:57,960
You work so hard
for the Som Song Saeng house,

285
00:22:58,560 --> 00:23:00,240
you deserve to spend some money.

286
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:02,920
I wouldn't dare.

287
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:05,720
Just having a job
and a place to live thanks to Uncle Som

288
00:23:05,800 --> 00:23:07,600
is more than enough.

289
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:12,240
Look, Fuang. You need
to be smarter than this.

290
00:23:12,320 --> 00:23:14,280
You're Uncle Som's niece.

291
00:23:14,360 --> 00:23:17,920
Why let them work you
to the bone for nothing?

292
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:21,560
It's time you find a way
to get your own share of the money.

293
00:23:27,120 --> 00:23:28,520
Oh, let's look over there.

294
00:23:48,600 --> 00:23:50,760
What on earth is this, Rajit?

295
00:23:53,640 --> 00:23:56,000
I'm sorry, Aunt Paetai, Aunt Fuang.

296
00:23:56,080 --> 00:23:58,920
But looking over the accounts,

297
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:00,560
the numbers don't match.

298
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:04,800
Our actual sales are much higher
than what's recorded.

299
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:07,440
A significant amount of money is missing.

300
00:24:10,040 --> 00:24:11,320
You must've miscalculated.

301
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:14,360
You're still a student,
so stop acting like a know-it-all.

302
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:18,640
If so, I'll just have to send
this account book to Grandpa Som instead.

303
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:24,680
Hey! Are you using
Uncle Som to threaten me?

304
00:24:24,760 --> 00:24:26,760
Calm down, sister.

305
00:24:28,800 --> 00:24:31,040
Can I see it, dear?

306
00:24:31,120 --> 00:24:32,120
Of course.

307
00:24:43,760 --> 00:24:48,600
It's not a large sum,
so let's not bother Uncle Som.

308
00:24:49,960 --> 00:24:53,520
The two of us will cover
the missing money ourselves

309
00:24:53,600 --> 00:24:56,960
to make up for our oversight.

310
00:25:00,880 --> 00:25:04,800
Alright. However, I still
have to let Grandpa Som know

311
00:25:05,400 --> 00:25:07,840
to prevent any future errors.

312
00:25:07,920 --> 00:25:09,640
I'm sorry to trouble you.

313
00:25:18,520 --> 00:25:20,000
Ugh. What a brat.

314
00:25:20,080 --> 00:25:23,320
Acting so high and mighty
just because she's Uncle Som's favorite.

315
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:27,040
I warned you not to skim the money,
but you wouldn't listen.

316
00:25:27,120 --> 00:25:30,640
Oh, please. Our allowance
is barely enough to survive on.

317
00:25:30,720 --> 00:25:32,760
Stop being such a coward.

318
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:36,160
At most, we'll just get a little scolding.

319
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,440
I don't care.

320
00:25:47,320 --> 00:25:48,400
Damn you, Rajit.

321
00:25:55,600 --> 00:25:57,080
If it weren't for you,

322
00:25:57,160 --> 00:26:00,640
I wouldn't have needed Zhang Gong Cheng
to do all this dirty work.

323
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:03,640
Was the allowance Grandpa Som provided

324
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:06,840
still not enough for you?

325
00:26:06,920 --> 00:26:09,280
Compared to what you got,
do you think it's enough?!

326
00:26:10,240 --> 00:26:13,360
-But--
-I built this wealth for Uncle Som,

327
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:17,880
while you just sat there and had it all.
Is that fair to you?! Huh?

328
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:21,920
Shut up and move! Go!

329
00:26:24,880 --> 00:26:29,600
Walk. I told you to walk. Hurry up.

330
00:26:36,520 --> 00:26:38,120
Is that Miss Fuangfah's car?

331
00:26:43,520 --> 00:26:44,840
It is.

332
00:26:54,200 --> 00:26:55,640
Nid! Nid!

333
00:26:57,440 --> 00:26:58,840
Nid.

334
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:01,680
-Nid.
-Nid.

335
00:27:01,760 --> 00:27:03,560
Nid, can you hear me?

336
00:27:04,800 --> 00:27:07,200
Where are Miss Rajit and Ms. Fuangfah now?

337
00:27:12,840 --> 00:27:13,680
Nid.

338
00:27:18,520 --> 00:27:20,080
Mr. Thatri.

339
00:27:21,640 --> 00:27:22,800
Miss Rajit…

340
00:27:23,800 --> 00:27:26,360
-Miss Rajit…
-Where is she?

341
00:27:28,920 --> 00:27:31,080
Ms. Fuangfah took Miss Rajit…

342
00:27:31,920 --> 00:27:32,880
right that way, sir.

343
00:27:39,200 --> 00:27:41,200
He's losing too much blood.

344
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:43,320
He won't make it if we leave him.

345
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:46,240
Listen, I'll stay behind
to stop the bleeding.

346
00:27:46,840 --> 00:27:48,280
You go find Miss Rajit.

347
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:50,760
Understood.

348
00:27:50,840 --> 00:27:52,280
Be careful out there.

349
00:27:58,240 --> 00:27:59,320
Keep moving.

350
00:28:00,400 --> 00:28:01,400
Move it.

351
00:28:04,560 --> 00:28:05,840
Walk faster.

352
00:28:14,320 --> 00:28:16,360
You're getting on that boat with me.

353
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:21,400
-But--
-Stop stalling, or I'll shoot you dead.

354
00:28:24,280 --> 00:28:26,280
Police! Police!

355
00:28:26,360 --> 00:28:28,280
Over here! I'm right here!

356
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:31,120
Police! Over here!

357
00:28:31,200 --> 00:28:33,880
You think I'm stupid enough
to fall for that?

358
00:28:35,800 --> 00:28:37,000
This way!

359
00:28:37,080 --> 00:28:40,360
Help me! Police!

360
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:43,360
I'm right here!

361
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:53,160
Argh! Damn you, Rajit!

362
00:28:55,520 --> 00:28:56,520
Rajit!

363
00:29:02,280 --> 00:29:03,360
Stop!

364
00:29:04,360 --> 00:29:05,720
Aunt Fuang.

365
00:29:06,360 --> 00:29:08,200
Please don't hurt me.

366
00:29:08,280 --> 00:29:11,960
I was going to sell you
to a brothel on the coast,

367
00:29:12,560 --> 00:29:13,880
but you're too much trouble.

368
00:29:14,760 --> 00:29:15,840
You can die right here!

369
00:29:15,920 --> 00:29:17,000
No, Aunt Fuang!

370
00:29:28,600 --> 00:29:29,440
Rajit…

371
00:29:30,760 --> 00:29:32,240
You're being such a pain.

372
00:29:43,320 --> 00:29:44,880
You have nowhere left to run.

373
00:29:46,560 --> 00:29:48,000
Go to hell, Rajit!

374
00:29:59,720 --> 00:30:00,680
Uncle Ree…

375
00:30:09,560 --> 00:30:10,560
Rajit.

376
00:30:10,640 --> 00:30:12,720
-Uncle Ree.
-Rajit.

377
00:30:12,800 --> 00:30:13,920
Are you alright?

378
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:17,720
I'm fine. How did you get here?

379
00:30:17,800 --> 00:30:19,280
No time for that now.

380
00:30:37,120 --> 00:30:40,160
Uncle Ree…

381
00:30:42,160 --> 00:30:47,840
Uncle Ree! Uncle Ree!

382
00:30:50,120 --> 00:30:50,960
Freeze!

383
00:30:52,440 --> 00:30:55,600
Don't move! Drop the weapon,

384
00:30:56,480 --> 00:30:58,000
or I will shoot.

385
00:31:00,560 --> 00:31:01,800
I said drop the gun.

386
00:31:21,680 --> 00:31:23,080
Ms. Fuangfah,

387
00:31:23,920 --> 00:31:25,320
you are under arrest.

388
00:31:25,400 --> 00:31:27,800
Let go of me! Let me go!

389
00:31:34,000 --> 00:31:38,320
Uncle Ree, can you hear me? Uncle Ree.

390
00:31:38,400 --> 00:31:40,960
Please wake up.

391
00:31:41,880 --> 00:31:43,640
Uncle Ree.

392
00:31:44,320 --> 00:31:48,840
Please wake up, Uncle Ree.

393
00:32:13,160 --> 00:32:14,360
Uncle Ree…

394
00:32:15,840 --> 00:32:16,720
Rajit…

395
00:32:20,520 --> 00:32:23,400
Making your move on me already, Uncle Ree?

396
00:32:29,560 --> 00:32:30,960
Stop daydreaming, Primprao.

397
00:32:35,760 --> 00:32:38,280
Rajit asked the two of us
to watch over you.

398
00:32:38,360 --> 00:32:42,080
You wouldn't wake up, and she was scared
something awful would happen to you.

399
00:32:44,320 --> 00:32:46,720
Do you want to get up? Let me help.

400
00:32:46,800 --> 00:32:48,760
Stop taking advantage of my Uncle Ree.

401
00:32:50,200 --> 00:32:52,640
It's fine, Nareewan.
I'll do it. It's alright, dear.

402
00:32:52,720 --> 00:32:55,320
-You've done plenty already.
-Nareewan.

403
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:56,360
Uncle Ree…

404
00:32:58,280 --> 00:33:00,640
See that? You completely ruined my chance.

405
00:33:00,720 --> 00:33:02,640
You've had more than enough chances.

406
00:33:02,720 --> 00:33:04,600
-He belongs to me.
-He belongs to me too.

407
00:33:04,680 --> 00:33:06,760
-He's mine. Uncle Ree.
-Uncle Ree.

408
00:33:11,520 --> 00:33:13,280
Please be safe, Uncle Ree.

409
00:33:14,560 --> 00:33:18,120
A one-winged bird cannot fly alone.

410
00:33:20,520 --> 00:33:23,080
<i>They must stay in pairs to take flight.</i>

411
00:33:47,520 --> 00:33:49,800
Is something the matter, Jiam?

412
00:33:49,880 --> 00:33:51,880
Mr. Thatri is awake.

413
00:33:52,480 --> 00:33:54,280
-Really?
-Yes.

414
00:34:14,480 --> 00:34:15,880
You've only just woken up.

415
00:34:15,960 --> 00:34:17,960
Who told you to go outside, Tri?

416
00:34:18,040 --> 00:34:20,719
It'll be bad if your wound gets infected.

417
00:34:23,679 --> 00:34:24,880
Girls.

418
00:34:26,679 --> 00:34:27,880
Where is Uncle Ree?

419
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:32,960
Well, I…

420
00:34:37,080 --> 00:34:38,280
Rajit.

421
00:34:39,040 --> 00:34:40,960
Seems like you're completely fine now.

422
00:34:50,320 --> 00:34:51,239
Rajit.

423
00:34:53,480 --> 00:34:57,200
Please rest first, Tri.
You can make it up to her later.

424
00:35:02,240 --> 00:35:03,520
Careful, now.

425
00:35:27,040 --> 00:35:30,640
She's a married woman, but she still
throws herself at our Uncle Ree.

426
00:35:30,720 --> 00:35:34,040
Exactly. Clinging to him
and not letting him go.

427
00:35:34,120 --> 00:35:35,360
How inappropriate.

428
00:35:36,600 --> 00:35:38,400
I feel sorry for the District Chief.

429
00:35:42,840 --> 00:35:43,960
Rajit.

430
00:35:49,600 --> 00:35:51,400
What did you guys just say?

431
00:35:52,760 --> 00:35:54,280
Ms. Sasitorn, of course.

432
00:35:54,360 --> 00:35:57,400
She's married but has the nerve
to fawn over our Uncle Ree.

433
00:35:57,480 --> 00:35:59,360
She shows no respect for her own husband.

434
00:36:00,640 --> 00:36:04,480
Right? If the District Chief
saw this, I bet…

435
00:36:05,640 --> 00:36:06,720
What?

436
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:13,280
They were past lovers,
so it's only natural that…

437
00:36:31,200 --> 00:36:32,400
District Chief.

438
00:36:33,320 --> 00:36:34,360
Well…

439
00:36:35,760 --> 00:36:37,040
I just came to tell you

440
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:39,360
that I'm feeling much better.

441
00:36:40,120 --> 00:36:41,760
I'll be heading home to rest,

442
00:36:42,920 --> 00:36:43,960
so I came to say goodbye.

443
00:36:45,680 --> 00:36:46,560
I see.

444
00:36:49,280 --> 00:36:50,640
Thank you very much.

445
00:37:18,480 --> 00:37:20,800
Are you going to stare
at that door all day?

446
00:37:20,880 --> 00:37:23,880
Should I go get Rajit for you?

447
00:37:25,240 --> 00:37:26,200
No need.

448
00:37:26,720 --> 00:37:28,840
I wasn't looking for her anyway.

449
00:37:31,040 --> 00:37:33,320
Is that so?

450
00:37:34,280 --> 00:37:37,280
Actually, your injury doesn't look bad,
just like what the doctor told Aunt Jiam.

451
00:37:39,240 --> 00:37:41,240
Did you go ask Aunt Jiam?

452
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:42,760
Of course.

453
00:37:42,840 --> 00:37:45,880
Aunt Jiam told me that Rajit
stayed by your side all night.

454
00:37:45,960 --> 00:37:49,840
Even when the doctor confirmed
you were fine, she wouldn't believe it

455
00:37:49,920 --> 00:37:51,760
and kept crying her eyes out.

456
00:38:03,360 --> 00:38:05,240
Aren't you going to tell her the truth?

457
00:38:09,040 --> 00:38:10,480
I want to tell her.

458
00:38:11,720 --> 00:38:12,640
But…

459
00:38:12,720 --> 00:38:13,680
Your porridge is here.

460
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:21,840
The District Chief wanted you to know
he went back to his place.

461
00:38:21,920 --> 00:38:25,040
He'll send a car back for you
once he's there.

462
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:31,120
Did he leave by himself?

463
00:38:31,720 --> 00:38:32,800
Yes, ma'am.

464
00:38:35,560 --> 00:38:37,800
Thank you, Auntie.

465
00:38:46,560 --> 00:38:49,000
He's probably just feeling hurt.
Don't worry about it.

466
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:52,320
Yes.

467
00:38:58,080 --> 00:39:00,400
THALANG PROVINCIAL POLICE STATION

468
00:39:00,480 --> 00:39:02,360
I never thought

469
00:39:02,440 --> 00:39:05,400
my own sister could be this wicked.

470
00:39:06,080 --> 00:39:08,600
Didn't you want me to be wicked like you?

471
00:39:08,680 --> 00:39:10,840
You should be proud of me.

472
00:39:12,160 --> 00:39:15,440
But this is too far.

473
00:39:15,520 --> 00:39:18,760
You murdered someone and broke the law.

474
00:39:18,840 --> 00:39:21,040
How could you do this, Fuang?

475
00:39:21,120 --> 00:39:22,400
And why the hell shouldn't I?

476
00:39:23,200 --> 00:39:25,960
Why shouldn't you?

477
00:39:26,040 --> 00:39:28,360
How can you say that?

478
00:39:28,440 --> 00:39:31,440
You sound like you have no conscience.

479
00:39:34,200 --> 00:39:35,760
You're just stupid.

480
00:39:36,560 --> 00:39:40,280
Your own stupidity is exactly
why you're locked up in this place.

481
00:39:41,160 --> 00:39:43,040
I'll never rot in prison.

482
00:39:45,720 --> 00:39:47,560
They're transferring you there right now,

483
00:39:47,640 --> 00:39:49,520
and you're still denying it?

484
00:39:54,080 --> 00:39:57,360
I'm completely at a loss for words.

485
00:40:05,560 --> 00:40:06,640
Sister…

486
00:40:07,880 --> 00:40:09,120
Fuang.

487
00:40:12,280 --> 00:40:14,360
I'll find a way to get you out.

488
00:40:16,360 --> 00:40:17,480
Just hang in there.

489
00:40:19,400 --> 00:40:20,600
Please.

490
00:40:25,120 --> 00:40:26,440
Visiting hours are over.

491
00:40:27,680 --> 00:40:28,520
Right.

492
00:40:34,520 --> 00:40:35,360
I'm leaving now.

493
00:40:47,520 --> 00:40:48,720
Someone like me

494
00:40:49,720 --> 00:40:52,080
doesn't need any help from you.

495
00:41:14,760 --> 00:41:15,760
What are you doing?

496
00:41:17,200 --> 00:41:20,440
I'm working. Can't you see?

497
00:41:33,360 --> 00:41:35,120
Are you okay, Uncle Ree?

498
00:41:36,320 --> 00:41:38,160
My wound hurts so badly.

499
00:41:38,800 --> 00:41:42,160
I don't know if the stitches tore.
Can you check?

500
00:41:42,240 --> 00:41:43,880
See if it's bleeding?

501
00:41:47,360 --> 00:41:48,800
It's not bleeding at all.

502
00:41:54,200 --> 00:41:55,040
Why am I so dizzy?

503
00:41:56,040 --> 00:41:57,200
Uncle Ree.

504
00:41:58,400 --> 00:41:59,440
Please sit down first.

505
00:42:38,000 --> 00:42:39,160
How are you feeling?

506
00:42:41,040 --> 00:42:41,880
I'm hungry.

507
00:42:44,200 --> 00:42:48,120
The patient needs to eat.
Can you find something for me to eat?

508
00:42:49,840 --> 00:42:51,080
Didn't Jiam

509
00:42:52,040 --> 00:42:54,280
just give you something to eat?

510
00:42:57,400 --> 00:42:58,440
Well, I'm still hungry.

511
00:42:59,680 --> 00:43:01,000
Just make me something.

512
00:43:02,120 --> 00:43:03,960
I want to eat your cooking.

513
00:43:05,720 --> 00:43:07,800
Okay, fine.

514
00:43:08,880 --> 00:43:10,280
Please wait a moment.

515
00:43:33,120 --> 00:43:34,880
We have mullet at home today,

516
00:43:34,960 --> 00:43:37,240
so I made turmeric fish soup.

517
00:43:37,320 --> 00:43:41,360
I made it less spicy for you.
I hope you like it, Uncle Ree.

518
00:43:45,240 --> 00:43:46,600
It looks delicious.

519
00:43:53,880 --> 00:43:57,880
My arm hurts so much.
I can't even hold the utensils.

520
00:44:05,120 --> 00:44:07,800
Let me feed you then.

521
00:44:25,280 --> 00:44:26,360
It's delicious.

522
00:44:26,440 --> 00:44:29,200
Right? Have another bite.

523
00:44:38,480 --> 00:44:39,720
Here.

524
00:44:44,800 --> 00:44:45,840
Let's have one more.

525
00:44:46,600 --> 00:44:48,320
You said you were hungry.

526
00:44:49,800 --> 00:44:51,000
Here.

527
00:45:03,920 --> 00:45:06,240
You're just faking this pain, aren't you?

528
00:45:06,320 --> 00:45:08,560
No, I'm not. It really hurts.

529
00:45:11,800 --> 00:45:13,040
Please feed me.

530
00:45:14,000 --> 00:45:19,120
If you want me to feed you,
you have to speak to me nicely.

531
00:45:23,360 --> 00:45:24,880
Please feed me, pretty please?

532
00:45:25,920 --> 00:45:26,880
One more time.

533
00:45:28,320 --> 00:45:29,920
Please feed me, pretty please?

534
00:45:30,960 --> 00:45:32,160
Alright then.

535
00:45:33,800 --> 00:45:34,760
Here.

536
00:45:38,280 --> 00:45:39,240
Have another bite.

537
00:45:46,120 --> 00:45:48,040
-That's enough.
-Huh?

538
00:45:48,120 --> 00:45:49,560
Water, please.

539
00:45:51,840 --> 00:45:52,720
Pretty spicy, huh?

540
00:45:57,960 --> 00:46:00,120
Oh, slow down.

541
00:46:12,720 --> 00:46:14,600
Let me clean your wound.

542
00:46:16,040 --> 00:46:17,040
Alright.

543
00:46:27,360 --> 00:46:31,480
Why did you
leave so abruptly today?

544
00:46:33,920 --> 00:46:35,680
I needed to clear some work.

545
00:46:36,880 --> 00:46:39,200
And I saw you looking after Mr. Thatri.

546
00:46:39,800 --> 00:46:42,440
I figured you could
say goodbye to him on my behalf.

547
00:46:44,800 --> 00:46:46,120
I only looked after Tri

548
00:46:46,200 --> 00:46:48,560
because he was injured, that's all.

549
00:47:07,920 --> 00:47:08,840
I know.

550
00:47:12,360 --> 00:47:14,720
You two used to be engaged, after all.

551
00:47:15,280 --> 00:47:17,080
It's normal to worry about him.

552
00:47:21,640 --> 00:47:23,000
You knew about this?

553
00:47:37,200 --> 00:47:38,800
THALANG PROVINCIAL POLICE STATION

554
00:47:40,320 --> 00:47:43,000
We need to transfer
the suspect for prosecution.

555
00:47:43,080 --> 00:47:44,520
We can't give you much time.

556
00:47:46,200 --> 00:47:48,920
It won't take long.
Just a brief moment, please.

557
00:47:49,000 --> 00:47:49,840
Alright.

558
00:47:53,360 --> 00:47:54,440
Fuang.

559
00:47:55,720 --> 00:47:58,880
I've been looking for a lawyer.
I searched all over Phuket.

560
00:47:58,960 --> 00:48:02,560
They said at worst, you'll face
no more than ten years in prison.

561
00:48:05,200 --> 00:48:08,760
But don't be scared.
I'll do everything I can to help you.

562
00:48:10,920 --> 00:48:12,120
Ten years?

563
00:48:14,400 --> 00:48:16,640
I'll be old and gray
by the time I'm released.

564
00:48:18,560 --> 00:48:20,280
Then what are you going to do?

565
00:48:22,280 --> 00:48:26,280
I brought this on myself.
I'll take care of it.

566
00:48:28,680 --> 00:48:31,640
Thank you anyway, Pae.

567
00:48:34,080 --> 00:48:34,920
This way, please.

568
00:48:35,640 --> 00:48:36,560
Let's go.

569
00:48:38,360 --> 00:48:39,200
This way.

570
00:48:54,080 --> 00:48:55,560
PHUKET HOTEL

571
00:48:55,640 --> 00:48:57,560
The District Chief knows
we used to be engaged?

572
00:48:57,640 --> 00:49:02,400
That's right. When Bundit told me,
I completely froze.

573
00:49:02,960 --> 00:49:04,880
How long has he known about it?

574
00:49:04,960 --> 00:49:06,640
Right from the very beginning.

575
00:49:07,400 --> 00:49:10,280
He said you're
a high-profile figure in Bangkok

576
00:49:10,360 --> 00:49:12,040
and everyone knows you.

577
00:49:12,120 --> 00:49:14,600
You were in the newspapers all the time.

578
00:49:14,680 --> 00:49:18,160
Did he give you a hard time about it?

579
00:49:25,320 --> 00:49:28,560
Why would I blame you?
You didn't do anything wrong.

580
00:49:29,560 --> 00:49:33,320
But I hid the truth from you
about my past engagement to Tri.

581
00:49:33,400 --> 00:49:36,600
You felt uncomfortable and didn't know
how to bring it up to me,

582
00:49:36,680 --> 00:49:38,440
so you chose to hide it. I get it.

583
00:49:38,520 --> 00:49:40,680
I don't blame you at all.

584
00:49:42,240 --> 00:49:45,240
I've known about you
and Mr. Thatri for a long time.

585
00:49:45,320 --> 00:49:49,520
But do you know why I agreed
to work with him anyway?

586
00:49:58,000 --> 00:50:00,080
Because I trust you,

587
00:50:02,520 --> 00:50:04,520
and I trust Mr. Thatri too.

588
00:50:07,280 --> 00:50:09,280
I know what kind of person you are.

589
00:50:12,360 --> 00:50:15,680
As for Mr. Thatri, I know I can trust him,

590
00:50:16,280 --> 00:50:18,080
and he's a good friend of mine.

591
00:50:18,960 --> 00:50:23,680
Do you know why
I called off the engagement with Tri?

592
00:50:25,480 --> 00:50:27,400
Because Mr. Thatri went bankrupt, right?

593
00:50:28,760 --> 00:50:30,600
Don't you despise me?

594
00:50:31,920 --> 00:50:34,360
Being married to such a selfish,

595
00:50:35,240 --> 00:50:36,800
materialistic woman like me?

596
00:50:50,120 --> 00:50:51,240
I love you.

597
00:50:52,040 --> 00:50:53,520
I've loved you for a long time.

598
00:50:54,800 --> 00:50:57,160
No matter why we married

599
00:50:57,880 --> 00:50:59,480
or what kind of person you used to be,

600
00:51:00,880 --> 00:51:03,680
nothing can ever change my love for you.

601
00:51:10,160 --> 00:51:12,200
May I hold you?

602
00:51:27,960 --> 00:51:29,920
It's alright. Don't cry anymore.

603
00:51:33,960 --> 00:51:36,000
I'll be by your side forever.

604
00:51:42,160 --> 00:51:44,600
Hearing that is such a relief.

605
00:51:44,680 --> 00:51:48,240
I was so afraid
you and the District Chief would argue.

606
00:51:51,960 --> 00:51:54,480
-Sasi.
-Yes?

607
00:51:54,560 --> 00:51:56,600
Though I'm relieved,

608
00:51:56,680 --> 00:51:59,440
can I talk to him for a moment?

609
00:52:00,760 --> 00:52:02,240
What are you going to say to him?

610
00:52:08,120 --> 00:52:12,120
There's no need to apologize.
Like I told Sasi, I understand.

611
00:52:12,960 --> 00:52:16,600
I should also apologize to you
for not telling you

612
00:52:16,680 --> 00:52:18,400
that I am Sasi's fiancé.

613
00:52:20,160 --> 00:52:22,400
You were worried that if I knew the truth,

614
00:52:22,480 --> 00:52:24,240
I'd refuse to work with you?

615
00:52:24,320 --> 00:52:25,360
Yes.

616
00:52:25,440 --> 00:52:29,080
Then let's call it even. No hard feelings.

617
00:52:30,640 --> 00:52:33,280
Just please look after Sasi.

618
00:52:34,160 --> 00:52:36,840
I know she's in good hands with you.

619
00:52:38,760 --> 00:52:42,360
I love Sasi more than my own life.

620
00:52:42,960 --> 00:52:44,960
That, I can assure you.

621
00:52:58,400 --> 00:52:59,880
With the pirate issue settled,

622
00:53:00,520 --> 00:53:02,400
it's time to reveal your true self.

623
00:53:02,480 --> 00:53:03,960
Just waiting for your friend to take over.

624
00:53:05,360 --> 00:53:08,120
Yes. I just hope
there won't be any more trouble.

625
00:53:24,120 --> 00:53:26,440
Please stop. Help me, please.

626
00:53:26,520 --> 00:53:27,840
Whoa. Look out.

627
00:53:27,920 --> 00:53:28,760
Please stop.

628
00:53:28,840 --> 00:53:30,120
There's a person.

629
00:53:30,200 --> 00:53:33,440
What the hell?
He just jumped right out in front of us.

630
00:53:33,520 --> 00:53:37,040
Be careful, Sarge.
They might be trying to free the suspect.

631
00:53:37,120 --> 00:53:38,800
Let them try.

632
00:53:38,880 --> 00:53:40,120
Let's go take a look.

633
00:53:45,280 --> 00:53:46,320
Help me. Please help.

634
00:53:46,400 --> 00:53:47,400
What's the matter?

635
00:53:47,480 --> 00:53:49,880
My wife is going into labor.

636
00:53:49,960 --> 00:53:51,600
Please give her a ride.

637
00:53:52,720 --> 00:53:56,640
Hey. There's a pregnant woman
about to give birth. What should we do?

638
00:53:57,360 --> 00:53:58,960
Let the pregnant woman in,

639
00:53:59,040 --> 00:54:00,880
but the husband stays behind.

640
00:54:03,520 --> 00:54:04,440
Hang in there.

641
00:54:07,560 --> 00:54:08,800
Hey!

642
00:54:24,640 --> 00:54:28,480
Great job. I'll reward you well
once we get to Langkawi.

643
00:54:29,080 --> 00:54:30,080
Thank you, Boss.

644
00:54:30,160 --> 00:54:33,480
Let's go, before the police catch on.

645
00:54:38,000 --> 00:54:41,280
Get moving. What's wrong with you?
Why aren't you moving?

646
00:54:42,080 --> 00:54:43,040
We're leaving, alright.

647
00:54:43,680 --> 00:54:46,400
But only after we settle our debts first.

648
00:54:47,320 --> 00:54:48,480
Zhang Gong Cheng!

649
00:54:48,560 --> 00:54:49,840
You didn't expect this, huh?

650
00:54:50,680 --> 00:54:52,200
Surprised to see I'm still alive?

651
00:54:52,960 --> 00:54:54,200
What are you saying?

652
00:54:54,920 --> 00:54:56,680
I assumed you reached Langkawi before me.

653
00:54:56,760 --> 00:54:57,880
You're a brilliant liar.

654
00:54:59,160 --> 00:55:01,520
I truly admire your deceitfulness, Boss.

655
00:55:02,040 --> 00:55:05,040
But it's too late.
No one believes your lies anymore.

656
00:55:06,400 --> 00:55:08,320
Don't just stand there! Kill him!

657
00:55:08,400 --> 00:55:10,920
I'll pay you whatever you want! Kill him!

658
00:55:11,000 --> 00:55:12,240
You kill anyone who outlives their use.

659
00:55:13,240 --> 00:55:15,240
Who would ever be loyal to you?

660
00:55:22,320 --> 00:55:25,600
Zhang Gong Cheng. Spare my life, please!

661
00:55:26,520 --> 00:55:27,800
I'm begging you.

662
00:55:27,880 --> 00:55:29,480
I have a massive fortune.

663
00:55:29,560 --> 00:55:31,160
You can take all of it.

664
00:55:57,960 --> 00:55:59,200
It's alright.

665
00:56:02,920 --> 00:56:04,120
Aunt Paetai.

666
00:56:05,720 --> 00:56:07,080
Aunt Paetai.

667
00:56:09,800 --> 00:56:11,440
Aunt Paetai.

668
00:56:13,440 --> 00:56:15,520
Fuang is dead.

669
00:56:16,360 --> 00:56:17,840
This is all wrong.

670
00:56:18,520 --> 00:56:20,920
I promised to get a lawyer for her.

671
00:56:21,000 --> 00:56:23,680
Why did she choose to escape?

672
00:56:25,560 --> 00:56:29,440
Aunt Paetai, let's not dwell on that now.

673
00:56:30,680 --> 00:56:33,880
Let's focus on arranging
Aunt Fuang's funeral together.

674
00:56:34,560 --> 00:56:36,800
I'll help you with it.

675
00:56:39,240 --> 00:56:42,760
Alright, Aunt Paetai? Please don't cry.

676
00:56:43,560 --> 00:56:45,200
Thank you, dear.

677
00:56:52,520 --> 00:56:55,400
Nid, keep an eye out for me.
I'll be right back.

678
00:56:56,440 --> 00:56:57,840
Where are you headed, sir?

679
00:56:58,560 --> 00:57:00,280
I'm giving a statement to the police.

680
00:57:01,840 --> 00:57:04,120
-Yes, sir.
-Uncle Ree.

681
00:57:05,120 --> 00:57:07,720
-Let me go with you.
-You can't.

682
00:57:07,800 --> 00:57:11,040
You must stay here.
We can't let our guard down.

683
00:57:14,840 --> 00:57:17,440
Aunt Jiam, please take good care of Rajit.

684
00:57:17,520 --> 00:57:19,360
Don't worry, sir.

685
00:57:19,440 --> 00:57:23,120
I'll lock all the doors and windows.
Make sure no one gets in or out.

686
00:57:23,720 --> 00:57:24,640
Thank you.

687
00:57:26,200 --> 00:57:27,720
Uncle Ree.

688
00:57:39,760 --> 00:57:41,600
Please be careful.

689
00:58:01,440 --> 00:58:02,320
Why are you helping me?

690
00:58:02,400 --> 00:58:04,880
I need a capable man like you on my side.

691
00:58:04,960 --> 00:58:07,680
For your first job, get rid of Thatri.

692
00:58:13,520 --> 00:58:14,760
Nurse.

693
00:58:14,840 --> 00:58:17,000
How's the patient who was shot?

694
00:58:17,080 --> 00:58:18,320
The patient has passed away.

695
00:58:20,600 --> 00:58:21,560
Why are you crying?

696
00:58:23,880 --> 00:58:26,160
Did you come to ask for my prayers?

697
00:58:29,600 --> 00:58:32,960
<i>I'm nearly healed.</i>
<i>I won't be bothering you much longer.</i>

698
00:58:33,040 --> 00:58:35,680
<i>See you in Phuket, Leopard.</i>

699
00:58:35,760 --> 00:58:37,760
I guess it's almost time for me to go.

700
00:59:06,560 --> 00:59:08,560
Subtitle translation by:
Khathathong Thongtumlueng
